@host = http://localhost:5080

### OData: customers whose name contains "an", ordered by name
GET {{host}}/odata/Customers?$filter=contains(tolower(name),'an')&$orderby=name&$count=true

### OData: products cheaper than 50, most expensive first
GET {{host}}/odata/Products?$filter=price lt 50&$orderby=price desc

### OData: active purchase orders, newest first
GET {{host}}/odata/PurchaseOrders?$filter=isArchived eq false and status eq 'Pending'&$orderby=timestamp desc&$top=10&$count=true

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane@example.com" }

### Create a purchase order
POST {{host}}/api/purchaseorders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "clientReference": "PO-TEST-001",
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### Purchase order details (with backend-calculated total)
GET {{host}}/api/purchaseorders/1

### Archive a purchase order
DELETE {{host}}/api/purchaseorders/1
